n a better time to step into the neon-soaked streets of Kings Cross.Frosty Games Fest 2026Night Shift: 1999 was featured as part of Frosty Games Fest 2026, the Australian and New Zealand showcase presented during Summer Game Fest.The event hig","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-12T05:09:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783562420","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3742150-1834602721200692","game_id":"steam-3742150","kind":"announcement","title":"Welcome to the very first dev log for Night Shift: 1999","summary":"Welcome to the very first dev log for Night Shift: 1999, a narrative visual novel set in the neon-shadows of Kings Cross, Sydney during the final year of the millennium. I’m Georgina Owassapian, the creator and developer behind the project. In this introductory episode, I am introducing you to this world and discuss how I am weaving themes of vampire lore with the real-world complexities of migrant identity. Whether you are here for the 90s nostalgia, the intersectional storytelling, or the indi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-09T03:17:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721200692","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3742150-1833968530899520","game_id":"steam-3742150","kind":"announcement","title":"Night Shift: 1999 Featured on ScreenHub","summary":"We're excited to share a new interview with Night Shift: 1999 creator Georgina Owassapian, recently published by ScreenHub.In the interview, Georgina discusses the inspirations behind Night Shift: 1999, including her own experiences migrating to Australia and how those experiences helped shape the game's story of identity, belonging, and reinvention through the lens of vampire fiction. The article also explores the game's distinctive 1-bit visual style, its development journey, and the challenge","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-02T06:26:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530899520","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3742150-1832700592785275","game_id":"steam-3742150","kind":"announcement","title":"NIGHTSHIFT 1999 Heads to Frosty Games Fest & PBS Radio","summary":"We’re excited to share that Georgina Owassapian and Nightshift 1999 is currently part of ANZ Indie Fest and will also be featured during Frosty Games Fest this June.As part of the Frosty celebrations, Georgina has also been invited to appear live on Melbourne radio program Game Jams on PBS 106.7FM on May 28th to discuss the development of NIGHTSHIFT 1999, the game’s soundtrack, and the creative process behind building its strange late night world.Game Jams broadcasts fortnightly Thursdays from 2","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-13T03:44:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592785275","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:50Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3742150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:22Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:21Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3742150":"2026-10-26T10:59:22Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3742150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:21Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:21Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:21Z"},"4152750":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:22Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:22Z